	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Admodum solicitus sum, colendissime mi domine <persName ref="p540">Cal<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>vine</persName>, frater in Christo dilectissime, quod metuam literas meas <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad te scriptas 12. ianuarii dolo interceptas esse, nec tibi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>redditas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Venit huc <placeName ref="l830">Anglus</placeName> quidam ex <placeName ref="l2472">Polonia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ac primum literas mihi reddidit acceptas a <persName>Philippo</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quarum exemplum, imo ipsum autographum, mitto.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Addidit alias quoque a d. <persName ref="p8061">Ioanne Utenhovio</persName> exaratas, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quas hic quoque coniunxi, ut quales sint videas.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Postremo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>asseveravit se literas ad te quoque habere scriptas a <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>d. <persName ref="p8041">Ioanne a Lasco</persName> quas nemini, nisi tibi soli, tradat <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in manus proprias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Adiecit, si quid scribere <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>velim ad <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName>, se quam diligentissime traditurum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>curaturumque, ac intra paucos dies re<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>diturum, ut per nos redeat nostris quoque literis onustus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>in <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Trado itaque ipsi literas ad te, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>in quibus brevibus et libere expono, quae acta sint <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>in colloquio <placeName ref="l569">Wormaciensi</placeName> in quo nominatim <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>damnatus sit <persName>Zvinglius</persName> noster, et confessio <placeName ref="l18">Augustana</placeName> sic <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>confirmata, ut professi sint, in ea se nihil mu<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tasse, neque unquam mutaturos esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Et alia huius generis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>plurima.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tradidi eidem literas ad d. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et scripta quaedam ac pecuniolam literis inclusam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Caeterum de his ne verbum scribit <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName>, neque <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>uspiam apparet <placeName ref="l830">Anglus</placeName> ille.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Qua(n)quam vero non <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sim suspiciosus neque male de peregrinis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sperem, attamen cum non redit neque ullus sermo <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>amplius de hoc homine fit, incipio anxie multa <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>mecum versare.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Si itaque venit <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> et literas <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>attulit meas, oro liberes me illa molestia etc.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Literas d. <persName ref="p4183">Iacobi Andreae</persName> dudum ad me missas, sed <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>aliquamdiu in acervo literarum amissas nunc <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>repertas remitto.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Tu Latinam meam summam <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ex libro eius collectam, olim quoque missam ad <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>te, per hunc tabellionem remitte, ac eidem literas <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName>Philippi</persName> et <persName ref="p8061">Utenhovii</persName> trade reportandas.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Si <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>vera sunt quae referunt, gravis domini manus est <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>in cervicibus <placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Si quid habes certi de <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ecclesiis <placeName>Gallicis</placeName> et vinctis, oro communices ut, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>si laeta sunt, gratias agamus, si tristia, supplicemus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>nos ama, ut soles.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Salvi sint fratres omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 20. februarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p540">Ioanni Calvino</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l167">Geneven(sium)</placeName> pastori <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fidelissimo vigilantissimoque <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo colendo fratrique <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>percharo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
